----- stdout -----
View and update workstation configuration

Usage: deadline config <COMMAND>

Commands:
  show   Show all workstation configuration settings and current values
  get    Print the value of a workstation configuration setting
  set    Set a workstation configuration setting
  clear  Clear a workstation configuration setting to restore its default
  gui    Open the workstation configuration settings GUI
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

